Z||000000||fierospeeder||10-23-2001||12:45 AM||||This is mostly for illinois people who grew up in the 70s or 80s, or if they are parents of kids who did etc.....<P><BR>I thought about this amusement park today and i searched the web and came up with only one site that had any info about it.<P>The park was located in oakbrook, il from 75? to 84 when it was auctioned/or sold.  <P>the land was sold to a developer that now has<BR>the tallest office building next to the buildings in chicago.  So now its something huge and you know what use to stand there&lt;TEAR&gt;<P>I was wondering if anyone went to that park, and if they got pics, i would love to see any.<BR> <A HREF="http://members.tripod.com/lisawebworld1/kiddiekingdom.html" TARGET=_blank>http://members.tripod.com/lisawebworld1/kiddiekingdom.html</A> <P><BR>or if people want to talk about their experiences in amusement parks, that will be KEWL also.<BR>||||reg||1
